# Healthcare Analysis Report — Continental Hospitals

## Overview
A Power BI reporting tool built to benchmark hospital performance against national averages, comparing patient experience, safety of care, and operational metrics across facility types and years.

![Dashboard Screenshot](healthcare-dashboard.png)

> Note: Built in Power BI Desktop. Source .pbix file not included — visual above is an exported screenshot.

## Key Insights
- 89.35% of facilities offered emergency services, while 10.65% did not
- Hospital overall ratings varied significantly by ownership type, with rating "3" most common
- Safety-of-care scores dropped sharply after Acute Care and Critical Access hospital types
- Facility and ownership counts showed a notable jump between 2018 and 2020, then plateaued

## Tools Used
- Power BI Desktop
- DAX (national comparison flags, aggregations)
- Dual-axis and small-multiple charts for comparative analysis

## Dataset
Hospital compare dataset (facility ratings, patient experience, safety of care, ownership, emergency services by state).
